6d8353e0366acb038cf965f.webp?t=1667069437\" width=105 height=25 /></span> <br><br><strong> <h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strategy</h2> </strong><br>You choose how many enemies to spawn, and you choose when they charge at you. Different enemies spawn at different times. <br>This means you have to continuously make a tactical decision: How many of this type of enemy can I handle? <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/856550/extras/31981b14b57fee44633bae68a8a5f5b1.webp?t=1667069437\" width=105 height=25 /></span><br><br>Feel free to write a review, it would help a lil' indie developer out a great deal! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/856550/extras/9f7312cfbd41c50a492c223cd1244d6b.avif?t=1667069437\" width=380 height=124 /></span>","developers":["Challenge Yourself Gaming"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/856550/header.jpg?t=1667069437","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/856550/161507/67feac9b96e6cf290579d4608ef89410d87132a2/1751154011/dash_av1.mpd?t=1527103366","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/856550/161507/67feac9b96e6cf290579d4608ef89410d87132a2/1751154011/dash_h264.mpd?t=1527103366","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/856550/161507/67feac9b96e6cf290579d4608ef89410d87132a2/1751154011/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1527103366","id":256716081,"name":"Stabby Machine Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256716081/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1527103366"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/856